Description: ActivityTrack on the PC - rules, local copy and sync (Python 3)
 ActivityTrack records the work of freelancers and technicians: activities,
 travels, pauses and to-dos, on the Android app, on a web server of one's
 own and on the PC.
 .
 This library holds what the PC interfaces share: the rules of activities
 and to-dos as the app's, the local copy in SQLite, the sync with
 ActivityTrack Web as a paired device, the policy, the reminders' planner
 and the translations. The desktop tray application, the command line and
 the text interface depend on it; they share one data folder and one
 pairing.
 .
 This package installs the library for Python 3.
